      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-768-783"><rb>今</rb><rt>いま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-783-786">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-786-798"><rb>恁</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-798-801">う</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-801-813"><rb>云</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-813-833">ふのがある。</seg></p>
